6-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|title","text":"hafta, needa, useta"},{"key":"9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|title","text":"coulda, woulda, shoulda"},{"key":"93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|title","text":"dunno, dontcha, whatcha"},{"key":"7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|title","text":"outta, offa, cuppa"},{"key":"beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|title","text":"c'mon, gonna be, s'more"},{"key":"96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|title","text":"편한 의문문에서의 축약"},{"key":"aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|title","text":"숫자와 시간에서의 축약"},{"key":"294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|title","text":"probably, trying to, supposed to"},{"key":"5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|title","text":"let's, gimme that, y'all"},{"key":"1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|title","text":"빠른 말에서의 편한 숫자 읽기"},{"key":"69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|title","text":"편한 말투에서 한 음절이 줄어드는 단어"},{"key":"d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|title","text":"I'ma와 그 밖의 아주 편한 형태"},{"key":"551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|title","text":"편한 인사말 축약 더 보기"},{"key":"b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|title","text":"oughta, don't hafta, wantcha"},{"key":"a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|title","text":"유명한 극단적 축약: 'Did you eat yet?'"},{"key":"e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|title","text":"'because of'와 'sort of a'"},{"key":"d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|title","text":"편한 예/아니요: yep, nope, uh-huh"},{"key":"d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|title","text":"'want a'(사물)와 'want to'(동작)"},{"key":"6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|title","text":"wouldn't have → wouldn'ta"},{"key":"2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|title","text":"just 'cause, gonna need"},{"key":"233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|title","text":"ain't — am not, is not, are not"},{"key":"dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|title","text":"gotcha — got you"},{"key":"83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|title","text":"musta, mighta — must have, might have"},{"key":"ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|title","text":"shouldn'ta, couldn'ta — 부정 과거 조동사"},{"key":"7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|title","text":"g 탈락: doin', goin', talkin'"},{"key":"0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|title","text":"somethin', nothin', anythin'"},{"key":"cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|title","text":"'em — them"},{"key":"66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|title","text":"'n' — and"},{"key":"74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|title","text":"단독으로 쓰는 'cause — because"},{"key":"f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|title","text":"'course — of course"},{"key":"a1c62d96-731e-4d96-803e-33f2cd732fc7|title","text":"aight — all right"},{"key":"fd275dbf-ca1f-489e-93aa-a7928df2aa76|title","text":"letcha — let you"},{"key":"9bf1b2d8-c97b-4451-8371-0efb3b24ecd0|title","text":"jever — did you ever"},{"key":"82a1afdf-f024-41d9-bb83-15d15e39a5cf|title","text":"gonna hafta — going to have to"},{"key":"d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|title","text":"not gonna, wasn't gonna"},{"key":"b0c3028d-02d0-4b69-b6b0-310ed3468566|title","text":"innit — isn't it(영국 영어)"},{"key":"ddb8cc83-dc22-4690-8bab-748461e813e9|title","text":"whaddya say — what do you say"},{"key":"16f619b1-adfc-405e-a120-14925cf94795|title","text":"y'know — you know(군말)"},{"key":"3b8f4cc8-03e2-4857-8f5b-1fdccc205c54|title","text":"s'up — what's up"},{"key":"6f674595-f4b4-44fa-9edf-d597d0a2e73a|title","text":"tell 'im, ask 'er — him, her"},{"key":"066faaed-c7b6-44d1-8bd5-0c29a8119dcb|title","text":"kinda sorta — 결합된 얼버무림 표현"},{"key":"5bee9ab9-fa4b-4174-b055-5e0daa1d4a08|title","text":"dincha — didn't you"},{"key":"b787eef9-022a-4553-a472-0e4e7077c0e4|title","text":"hadta — had to"},{"key":"0ea50af7-f1be-4ee5-90c9-acf52cfb6dbf|title","text":"willcha — will you"},{"key":"8eb2f2ac-a4c2-41e6-bc12-9cf7f4a95bc1|title","text":"lotsa, buncha — lots of, bunch of"},{"key":"643d42f4-55c6-49bb-ba59-6641d41b118a|title","text":"helluva — hell of a"},{"key":"d91f71d3-f31d-4215-8d05-8e8a07483832|title","text":"howdy — how do you do"},{"key":"4753